        "text_kxwwVM": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<h4>If the finger under your ring is red, itchy, or peeling, and it has been getting worse rather than better, the ring is the obvious suspect. Before you give up on it, one thing worth knowing: a true allergy to gold itself is rare. Far more often the problem is what the gold is mixed with — and that is a solvable problem, because your stones do not have to go anywhere.</h4><h4></h4>"
          }
        }
      },
